    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b5f242dfa53a0eb0072d1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<total_race_count>战<total_win>胜，大赛中数一数二还未尝败北滋味的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "864567a8100036cbe98f666d08ece808a93ef272e7f28a8da45a6328ed694276",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "7102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7d35864cdc0e107e44a567",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对大赛最被看好的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>给予强烈期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36063167f913ce68e5903c4041d744c69ffb91934be03ba16632bae5afb558a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "7200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ed463a36d68d10b713691b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也强烈期待能在本次竞赛中获胜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ef122ef3d50d4732ccd6373dc95307f0bc04be21fda70d2774c8ecb028fd52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "7201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b32c9661d82687f055f0579",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场竞赛也能以稳定的表现获得胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c052a9939ef9b5a72b0941cba570fe980d79ca7cb2887eff9ef52fbfd6e274",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "7202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8324b90a57562fbbb8d46b03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是第一次参加本次比赛的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5bac1b74be69c0fd88dacfb61bcc2d9dcf845c8100a98d01d238e1a7623a71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2369506343cd2f3b07d1b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>还未获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f96e5983fafc40e5b1d973e11eaca04ebbbbcf79869482b841eb239049313e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2449140fc6c9fc4ea86b675e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来胜利还没有降临。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5ca64786059e361ef2470e0e08b1b092d9ea56468b27b13d4c97acbe9ea9e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36cfcce703268542b638167d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来到这里首次参赛的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25c46139ee5bdd49267ed8c9c9868a1b84e96a36d63fb2bd330b8ec893ce32d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2e33d3f61fa7d86aa5555e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛首度登场的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9a4ee734d1bf1d616b3b5afddf8c3ff6337469de6bde8bdfe7eef5cfa0b683",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77ce606052118a1ba309052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登场时蓄势待发，初战即为决赛的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bc1733bec9c1ec94b9810c6122910883324c1686b9ec5d722ed66bb83b46ca2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0968a96609d2bb2034472468",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛没能掌握胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9cde5ebaee01d67a24f79e420c5708adf18d6447adeda3a790c2bf61065066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1689c04c2014248bd64b06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近是成绩没有起色的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0764f3ecacbea6f74e95e0dcc578b42452eaead31a6e86c78817d50e13bbb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17f345aa5d31e63fea7b6db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在本次大赛中还未获胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c15c5c0d48fdca6118db5cd29a93782eac8c9e9502a75deffa5dd840df0c6bee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940124c9af0a0d56aaed2b77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是在预赛隐藏实力的<color=#ff9900>「<trainer_name>」</color>的王牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81141a5496e690171317e5c50e6f2e497f28306e18ec0e09de2f2f6c23dc9feb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd08ad24b28c32c2e1bddb12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那至今尚未明了的实力终于要在这次大赛亮相。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1db294310ca3a24f0cd8935f1fc818c57058ae4f6012bcca55db6d87e582181",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4681e3b032b1f59c554967e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在绝不能输的场合骤然登场，似乎值得期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23ec31b09f4c8c85020424ebd6a6e568675ab66f3c8baa12b8d89c7d6a1cf9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3915cb5289e4b146a0537c0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尚未拿下过一胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "425a23d88682f4ed821e0d54ee51cb4a4460a20523e3910500f4f0ee71af594e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea308134056268081d1ef49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与同伴的合作也值得关注！",
      "source_fingerprint": "799115cfb47a68df199ec1a57dace426a29fc9ca2ec0c7d9f76c235e285999ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7eda72011b9b2b2b34ef83f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好，会展现出怎么样的表现呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae9673824fbe1398bfcc42c60c85dbf5dc39076d015ea26ba7738cbe59a4068",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef2dc6cc8e47fd55e4af95c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在首次参赛就以拿下冠军的结果获得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2028557b95c619fb07b800ebbedc84c8644857c27ea5abed6db86a9569beccbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "100202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9763bacb6fdc12cca5dc53fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首次参加<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dff8434be2bfb582e02c9ad9474ba810a7fbde50217cc5d35da49f0fdfe8a672",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eef50c28e33a9abf4ebc9e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过可以从其表现看出对胜利以及不想输的执着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "912631b2e36ed4cd34d63d72858491fb2dccc95e6d39805d0ca748dd228434bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb70624f3929dcaf0f48fad5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但从原本的实力来看，可说是持续留下非其所望的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb0b466f2c6c8e4588bfa1cc8af3e672f0d67ba2cf78b0598fedf32ce36bd83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d0d81f300d23e50dfd14d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过若能满足一些条件，就能大大改变结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1396bb09b5f56c3d5c515be2cf6ecfa962036051ca583859a6b6189666e0593",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88a26a7e496e510f0ea885c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要摆脱低潮，带给训练员和粉丝们好结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a28a7bbb4e4f12ea66412312bc2213adaf390473ded04c9db0a7feec84341d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9464c16ae5fb15cb9b78f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>出道的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7e07de5b80c108b685839c29836610aa3d3782ac1141e3f68817cafc83e94eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d8a7dc72995a4701b0d427",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望藉由这一战掌握某种契机……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "853f67d61e851c5780d154eb5ff87c1f9df809547d6732e957029a9625495b13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fc8af6aa00c0aeb1931006",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够掌握重要的1胜吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3d148d95510455fa64ba4881620cb48535fe876f3920a83a575dba35450663",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8acbc7bfec72d0dce3241a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就此期待局势逆转吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e28d1c4319cc172aa0ffd4ad1acf8a20043ef56a4d4cd4d0228953b7be8a004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187ff0d8d6bb43b33c24f822",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能将这场竞赛化为转机吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27be29a33d9512f291bae0c2940ea5f619135c8e35ce91d53f2fec0d1ae5868a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe76b569e99f0883aa536e21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，在累积经验后已能窥见胜机了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b7ae18171e2bdb3b6a3aba5248105766ad8281bdee802ac970d6868eb3bfb0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546fa079b21e7855f5b702c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得1胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1747aab19cba4a2e5dc492315baac0adeaccfce8a3a5be254b191202acd142e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383f951d1ee2dd30f0d656fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<trainer_name>」</color>的招牌赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d57121301d91b9a363529767d53c6f419821c720caeb8685cef3e74c90058a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa6c7ca31f8b7a5f09a310e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登上决赛也充满自信，值得关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e72890cc29a6bd6b618906e0b5e657a89aebcf5124102d73c4288ee5eefcce08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110001"
      ]
    }
  ]
